# Third-party notices

## CodeAssist

This library is inspired by the architecture of
[CodeAssist](https://github.com/tyron12233/CodeAssist) by tyron12233,
licensed under the GPL-3.0 license.

code-editor-lib is an independent implementation in Java for Android
(no shared source code with CodeAssist, which is written in Kotlin with
Compose Multiplatform). The architectural concepts — Rope-based document
model, incremental per-line tokenizer, IME bridge with composing-region
handling, per-line render cache, fold model, wrap model, signature help
controller, code actions controller, navigation menu — were studied from
CodeAssist's source and reimplemented from scratch.

We thank the CodeAssist team for the reference implementation that guided
the design of this library.

